Likutay Halachos — Evven Ha-Ezer — Pirya V'Rivya V'Ishus 2

@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,500&family=EB+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500&display=swap');

:root {

--gold: #8B7533; --gold-light: #C4A84C; --parchment: #FAF6EE; --parchment-dark: #F0E8D8;

--ink: #2C2418; --ink-light: #5C4A32; --accent-blue: #3A5A7C; --accent-red: #8B3A3A;

--border-ornament: #D4C5A0; --highlight-bg: #FFF8E1;

* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

body { background-color: var(--parchment); color: var(--ink); font-family: 'EB Garamond', 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.85; text-align: justify; padding: 0; }

.container { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 50px 80px; }

.main-title { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 30px 0 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--gold); }

.main-title h1 { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 2.2em; color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 4px; }

.main-title .subtitle { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.15em; color: var(--ink-light); font-style: italic; letter-spacing: 1px; }

.halacha-title { text-align: center; margin: 35px 0 20px; padding: 10px 0; }

.halacha-title h2 { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.65em; color: var(--accent-blue); letter-spacing: 1px; }

.halacha-preface { background: var(--parchment-dark); border-left: 4px solid var(--gold); padding: 18px 25px; margin: 20px 0 30px; font-size: 1.02em; font-style: italic; color: var(--ink-light); line-height: 1.9; }

.para { margin-bottom: 22px; text-indent: 2em; }

i { font-style: italic; }

.source-ref { font-size: 0.88em; color: var(--ink-light); }

.heb { font-family: 'SBL Hebrew', 'Ezra SIL', 'David', 'Times New Roman', serif; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-size: 1.05em; }

b { font-weight: 600; }

.scripture { font-style: italic; color: var(--accent-blue); }

.zohar { font-style: italic; color: var(--accent-red); }

.ornament-divider { text-align: center; margin: 30px 0; color: var(--border-ornament); font-size: 1.4em; letter-spacing: 8px; }

.translator-summary { margin-top: 50px; padding: 25px 30px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f7f3ea 0%, #ede5d5 100%); border: 2px solid var(--gold-light); border-radius: 6px; }

.translator-summary h3 { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.3em; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 14px; text-align: center; letter-spacing: 1px; }

.summary-content { font-size: 0.97em; color: var(--ink-light); line-height: 1.85; text-align: justify; }

.summary-content p { margin-bottom: 12px; text-indent: 0; }

.flow-chart { margin: 25px 0; padding: 20px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--border-ornament); border-radius: 6px; text-align: center; }

.flow-chart h4 { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.1em; color: var(--accent-blue); margin-bottom: 15px; }

.flow-box { display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; margin: 5px 4px; background: var(--parchment-dark); border: 1px solid var(--gold-light); border-radius: 5px; font-size: 0.92em; color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; }

.flow-arrow { display: inline-block; margin: 0 6px; color: var(--gold); font-size: 1.3em; vertical-align: middle; }

.flow-row { margin: 8px 0; }

Likutay Halachos

Evven Ha-Ezer

Hilchos Pirya V'Rivya V'Ishus 2

Every man is obligated to marry a wife, etc. Once a man has a male and a female [child], he has fulfilled the mitzvah of procreation, etc.
